perf 在 final F 重跑；修根因，或取得明確 comparator 決策，不可挑綠樣本或正規化輸出。\n- **B3｜required CI 未啟動。** head `597bce6` 的 Actions run [40070806058](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/actions/runs/40070806058) 七個 required jobs 全為 failure，且 runner/steps 空。最小修正：修復執行環境並在同一 head 取得正式 required jobs；若採替代驗收，先取得明確接受且綁定同一來源。\n\n## 須改\n- **C1｜正文不是 current state。** PR body 仍宣告 F=`2bbe54f…`、E=`3df56ff…` 與舊 CI runs；`PROGRESS.md:3-13` 已改為 R7 F=`6df0264…` 且 gates 全重置。最小修正：head 穩定後只保留一份 current-state 矩陣，更新 SHA、執行來源、未跑/紅燈與當前 CI。\n\n## 記錄\n- 目前非 evidence 產品差異只涉及 `.gitignore`、`_i11_two_surfaces_same_uv_accept.scene`、`current_geometry.c`；跨不同 support surface 的同 UV 測例符合 `公理層.md` I11「只比較同支撐面、共享邊合法」。\n- 新的 provider-hint focused proof 可保留作定向證據，但不能替代上述 R7 全量 gates。\n\n**結論：不建議合併；維持 draft。**","author_association":"OWNER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/comments/6381002511/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/comments/6394489169","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/338#issuecomment-6394489169","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/338","id":6394489169,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABfSQpUQ","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-25T06:41:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T06:41:10Z","body":"【ChatGPT 審查】PR #338 head 5f27125\n\n## 阻擋\n- **B1｜最終 F 的正式驗收仍未完成。** `evidence/geo337-train-20261024/PROGRESS.md:5-13` 顯示 tracked ledger check 仍為 exit 1（120 stale／3 retired），全量重產、完整 native、六 browser、P52、Q38(44)、§7、P-189、required-eight/PF3、reader/RC/#314/閱讀A仍為 **UNRUN**。最小修正：產品來源穩定後，在唯一 final F 依原命令、門檻與時限完成清單，保存 execution SHA、原始輸出與退出碼。\n- **B2｜R7 仍有兩類產品紅燈。** 同檔 `:7-9`：N64 已改善為 1.229223≤1.3，但 N16 fix/base=1.051906>1；175 scenes／350 runs 仍有 role-priority 與兩個 P8 stdout exact 差，outer=1。最小修正：修 N16 根因並以原 36 樣本重跑；exact 須恢復一致，或先取得並登記明確版本／comparator 裁決，不得重抽挑綠或正規化診斷。\n- **B3｜目前 head 的 required CI 仍未啟動。** `5f27125` 的 Actions run [40072501882](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/actions/runs/40072501882) 七個 required jobs 全 failure，抽查 job steps 為空。最小修正：修復執行環境並在同一 head 取得正式結果；若走替代驗收，須先有專案明確接受且綁定同一來源。\n\n## 記錄\n- 本次兩個新增提交只發布 evidence：完整 R7 原包 9,128 members／31,359,550B 已入庫並有 50,504/0 roundtrip；前次「原始封包未公開」缺口已解除，但封包成功不改原 N16/exact 紅燈。\n- PR 正文已把產品 F、證據 E、N64 改善與未跑項同步到目前版本；前次 C1 已修。\n\n**結論：不建議合併；維持 draft。**","author_association":"OWNER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/comments/6394489169/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/comments/6395515191","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/338#issuecomment-6395515191","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/338","id":6395515191,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABfTPRNw","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-25T08:40:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T08:40:58Z","body":"【ChatGPT 審查】PR #338 head 80fc475\n\n### 阻擋\n- **B1｜最終 F8 的正式驗收仍未完成。** `evidence/geo337-train-20261024/PROGRESS.md:9-13` 記錄 tracked ledger check 仍 exit1（120 stale／3 retired），全 123 重產仍 RUNNING；完整 native、六 browser、P52、Q38(44)、§7、P-189、required-eight/PF3、reader/RC/#314/閱讀A仍為 UNRUN。最小修正：固定 F8，等 ledger 與每項原 gate 真正終態，保存 execution SHA、原流與 exit；任一紅燈先修復再重跑。\n- **B2｜跨版本 exact 仍是產品紅燈。** 同檔 `:7`：175 scenes／350 runs 雖程序與 trace 為 0，role-priority 與兩個 P8 stdout 差仍使原 comparator exit1；`ABC_result` 缺席、`all_required=false`、`full_acceptance=null`。須恢復 exact，或先取得並登記 comparator／版本邊界的明確裁決，再用原樣本重跑；不得正規化或過濾必要 I22 診斷。\n- **B3｜目前 head 的 required CI 仍未啟動。** Actions run [40177371339](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/actions/runs/40177371339) 的 native＋六 browser 全為 failure，jobs 無 steps。最小修正：在同 head 取得正式 required 結果；若採替代驗收，須先有專案明確接受且綁定同一來源。\n\n### 須改\n- **C1｜PR 正文不是目前唯一狀態。** 正文仍宣告 F=`6df0264`、E=`5f27125` 與 R7/N16 紅；本 head 的 PROGRESS 已是 F8=`75a1e93`、R8 且四個性能門檻全綠。等 ledger 穩定後一次同步 F/E、R8、未跑／紅燈與當前 CI，避免讀者依過期矩陣判斷。\n\n### 記錄\n- 前次 N16 阻擋已實質解除：R8 N16/base=.983419，N32=.900793，N48=.739286，N64/main=1.284697，原 36 樣本未重抽；這不解除 exact 或全量 gate。\n- 本 head 的新工作是 evidence／準備紀錄，未再改產品；完整 R8 原包已公開可追溯。\n\n**結論：不建議合併；維持 draft。**","author_association":"OWNER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/comments/6395515191/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-c