ed-eight/PF3、reader/RC/#314/閱讀A原終態與原流；任一紅燈先修復。\n- **B2｜跨版本 exact 仍為紅燈。** 同檔 `:5-7,483-507` 仍保留 175 scenes／350 runs 的三個 stdout 差、原 comparator exit1、`ABC_result` 缺席與 `full_acceptance=null`；F9只採帳本/evidence，沒有取得 B′／C 裁決。須恢復 exact，或先正式登記 comparator／版本界線再依核可裁判重跑；不得過濾或正規化 I22 診斷。\n- **B3｜目前 head 的 required CI 仍未啟動。** Actions run [40183211769](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/actions/runs/40183211769) 的 native＋六 browser 全 failure，jobs 無 steps。最小修正：在同 final head 取得正式 required 結果；若採替代驗收，須先有專案明確接受且綁定同一來源。\n\n### 須改\n- **C1｜「唯一 current-state」內部互相矛盾。** PR 正文仍宣告 F=`6df0264`／E=`5f27125`／R7；PROGRESS `:3-19` 又把 F8/R8 稱唯一狀態，但 `:493-513` 已固定 F9並啟動 native。待當前批次終態後，只保留一份 F9 矩陣，逐列標 execution SHA、exit、RUNNING/UNRUN 與當前 CI。\n\n### 記錄\n- 前次 B1 的帳本缺口已實質解除：F8 full123 0、123列為114 killed／5 equivalent／1允許 crashed／3 retired；F9 採入後 tracked check 0、stale0／blocked0，架構0/0/0。這些進展不解除尚未終態的正式清單。\n- 本輪五個新增提交除 F9 帳本採用外均為 evidence/docs；非 evidence 產品仍沿用已通過 R8 性能的 F8 內容。\n\n**結論：不建議合併；維持 draft。**","author_association":"OWNER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/comments/6396620651/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.githu